The brand mark is the round scalloped badge on the client flyer: dark soil-textured disc, white outer scallop border, orange dotted inner ring, "MAIK GARDENS" arched across the top in orange condensed caps, crossed garden fork and shovel in orange in the middle, and a small "... Gold Coast ..." banner at the bottom.

