## 9. main.js Required Functionality

- **Accessible mobile nav toggle:** `button` with `aria-expanded` and `aria-controls`, operable by keyboard, closes on Escape and on outside click, focus returns to the button on close.
- **Smooth scroll** for on-page anchor links, switched off under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- **Scroll-triggered reveal** using `IntersectionObserver`, fully disabled (elements simply visible) when `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`.
- **Lightbox** for `work.html`: opens on click or Enter, traps focus, closes on Escape and on backdrop click, arrow keys move between images, restores focus to the thumbnail on close, `aria-modal` and a labelled dialog role.
- **Click-to-call:** every phone number is a `tel:+61406851039` link. On the sticky call bar, add `aria-label="Call Maik Gardens"`.
- **Current-page nav state:** mark the active link with `aria-current="page"`.
- **No contact form handling.** There is no backend. Contact is click-to-call only. Leave a clear comment saying so.
- Wrap anything that touches optional elements in null checks so no page throws console errors.

